    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT LOOPS is a psychological horror game where you\u2019re trapped in a never-ending street loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully observe the street you are on, and when you reach the end, make a decision based on your observations. If you notice an anomaly, choose the door on the right. If you don\u2019t, choose the door on the left and make a decision about that street.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wrong decision sends you back to the beginning.<br>The right ones take you one step closer to the exit.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: Approximately 1.5 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls: Keyboard and mouse (Move with WASD, look around with mouse)</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT LOOPS is a psychological horror game where you\u2019re trapped in a never-ending street loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully observe the street you are on, and when you reach the end, make a decision based on your observations. If you notice an anomaly, choose the door on the right. If you don\u2019t, choose the door on the left and make a decision about that street.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wrong decision sends you back to the beginning.<br>The right ones take you one step closer to the exit.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: Approximately 1.5 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls: Keyboard and mouse (Move with WASD, look around with mouse)</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "You are trapped in a never-ending street loop. Observe your surroundings carefully and identify anomalies. Make the right choice at the end of each street and try to escape the loop.",
